REMARK 245  A QUICK FROZEN, ISOMETRICALLY CONTRACTING ASYNCHRONOUS INSECT       
REMARK 245  FLIGHT MUSCLE THAT HAS BEEN FREEZE SUBSTITUTED, PLASTIC EMBEDDED,   
REMARK 245  AND THIN SECTIONED. THE FIBERS FOR THIS STUDY WERE SUBJECTED TO     
REMARK 245  MECHANICAL TRANSIENTS. FOR THE QUICK STRETCH, THE FIBER WAS         
REMARK 245  STRETCHED 6 NM PER HALF-SARCOMERE IN 2 MS AND LENGTH WAS HELD       
REMARK 245  CONSTANT AFTER THE LENGTH STEP. THE FREEZING IMPACT OCCURRED 6-7    
REMARK 245  MS LATER.                                                           
